<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-AUSTRALIA BEATS TRANSVAAL INVITATION XI BY 79 RUNS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-AUSTRALIA BEATS TRANSVAAL INVITATION XI BY 79 RUNS.</headline>
<dateline>SOWETO, South Africa 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia beat a Transvaal Invitation XI by 79 runs in a 45 overs a side one-day match at Elkah Stadium in Soweto on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Scores: Australia 261-7, 45 overs, Transvaal Invitation XI 182 all out, 42 overs.</p>
